{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Shuttle Mining</strong> is a <i>Noita</i>- and <i>Terraria</i>-inspired mining game. Craft your own unique lasers, burn, taze, and make things explode.\u00a0Explore a destructible underground world full of danger, upgrades, and wild laser experiments. <i>Shuttle Mining</i> mixes sandbox creativity with fast-paced chaos in a cozy pixel-art universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Craft Lasers:</strong> In <i>Shuttle Mining</i>, you can create your own unique weapons by using modules. Some modules increase a bullet\u2019s size, some make it explosive, and others make it burn. There are nearly endless possibilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595480/extras/CreatedwithGameMaker2025-04-0510-16-04-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1745420400\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fight Enemies:</strong> In order to find new modules, you'll need to beat enemies and get the recipes and materials to build modules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595480/extras/ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter__1_.gif?t=1745420400\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mining:</strong> Using good lasers takes a lot of energy. To upgrade the player and your battery, you'll have to dig for ores and minerals and craft new items!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595480/extras/ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1745420400\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3595480?t=1745420